  SELECTION: lc_correct_% < 50% (catches more wrong than right), then maximise auto-close coverage
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  NO combination in the grid gets the trigger below 50%.
  The best available is min_top1=0.0, min_margin=0.01 at 86.568% — still
  escalating more correct rows than wrong ones.

  RECOMMENDATION: DROP the low_confidence trigger entirely rather than ship
  one that fires indiscriminately. Setting both thresholds to 0.0 disables
  it and is what is applied below.

